 ('triton','Triton review','Jeff Riggenbach, Prometheus/LFS','https://www.lfs.org/newsletter/016/02/Triton.shtml','secondary_critical_economic_summary','Food/shelter cannot legally be denied, while computer accounts track work and other purchases; political choice is polycentric.','The review explicitly calls the economic mechanism sketchy; accounting automation does not prove production automation.'),
