 ('aristoi-author','Aristoi','Walter Jon Williams','https://www.walterjonwilliams.net/books/aristoi','author_book_description','The author identifies post-scarcity and elite nanotechnological rule as central setting features.','A short author description, not the complete book or a guaranteed absence of useful work.'),
 ('aristoi','Aristoi setting','Wikipedia contributors','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aristoi_(novel)','secondary_setting_reference','Only Aristoi can wield nanotechnology; ordinary Demos enjoy comfort and comprehensive healing.','General Logarchy rather than the secret involuntary world; examination access to elite status is not equal control.'),
